<p>Many thanks to Drewbear, who gave me a key idea during the initial stages of the draft. Further thanks to Scantron, Djoric, DrMann, Jekeled, Eric_H (naming credit!), thedeadlymoose, MisterFlames, Rumetzen, and Silberescher who all gave me feedback and suggestions during the later stages.</p>
<p>Totally belated edit: Thanks to Scantron for photoshopping the original picture to make it look nicer. For the record, the picture was taken by me with my cell phone, at my university.</p>
<p>This took awhile to write, admittedly. Yes, there are references to Greek Mythology.</p>
